closed:      (ab)
open group:  the pattern ends inside a group, class, count or escape
stray close: a `)` in the pattern closes no group
open class:  the pattern ends inside a group, class, count or escape
open count:  the pattern ends inside a group, class, count or escape
lone escape: the pattern ends inside a group, class, count or escape
open ahead:  the pattern ends inside a group, class, count or escape
